1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:01,200
What I want is there.

2
00:00:01,262 --> 00:00:02,523
A home.

3
00:00:02,583 --> 00:00:04,631
A-Ling, affection: sixty-one.

4
00:00:05,487 --> 00:00:06,666
What kind of answer is that…

5
00:00:07,114 --> 00:00:09,681
All three wives' affection

6
00:00:09,765 --> 00:00:11,598
has passed sixty.

7
00:00:12,659 --> 00:00:14,786
Grand prize unlocked.

8
00:00:16,618 --> 00:00:19,847
Grand prize: the gunpowder formula.

9
00:00:19,938 --> 00:00:20,944
Gunpowder…

10
00:00:22,650 --> 00:00:23,484
With this,

11
00:00:23,609 --> 00:00:25,871
who'd dare take my family?

12
00:00:27,726 --> 00:00:28,750
But it can also

13
00:00:28,803 --> 00:00:30,958
kill a lot of people.

14
00:00:32,892 --> 00:00:33,373
Seal it.

15
00:00:33,696 --> 00:00:35,372
Not even I will open it.

16
00:00:35,590 --> 00:00:37,130
Seal confirmed.

17
00:00:39,440 --> 00:00:40,393
What are you thinking?

18
00:00:40,774 --> 00:00:42,193
Something that could kill a lot of people.

19
00:00:42,794 --> 00:00:44,300
Locked, for now.

20
00:00:46,472 --> 00:00:46,995
Keep it locked.

21
00:00:50,072 --> 00:00:50,579
What a welcome,

22
00:00:51,001 --> 00:00:53,293
livelier than the prefecture city!

23
00:00:53,612 --> 00:00:54,983
Our Liuxi

24
00:00:55,054 --> 00:00:57,222
has produced a Jieyuan!

25
00:00:57,296 --> 00:00:58,318
Brother!

26
00:00:58,496 --> 00:00:59,994
Sister A-Ling said

27
00:01:00,052 --> 00:01:01,519
you'd come back for sure!

28
00:01:02,155 --> 00:01:03,627
Sister A-Ling!

29
00:01:05,913 --> 00:01:08,420
H-Honored Jieyuan…

30
00:01:08,560 --> 00:01:09,827
Squire Qian,

31
00:01:09,894 --> 00:01:11,571
that kowtow you promised—

32
00:01:12,110 --> 00:01:12,813
I-I…

33
00:01:14,403 --> 00:01:15,182
Forget it.

34
00:01:15,239 --> 00:01:16,549
A bow will do.

35
00:01:18,889 --> 00:01:19,622
This account,

36
00:01:20,266 --> 00:01:22,084
is finally settled.

37
00:01:24,173 --> 00:01:24,994
Brother,

38
00:01:25,059 --> 00:01:26,543
what's a Jieyuan?

39
00:01:27,067 --> 00:01:27,634
It means from now on,

40
00:01:28,016 --> 00:01:29,406
no one will dare pick on you.

41
00:01:29,485 --> 00:01:31,102
Miss Tang!

42
00:01:31,487 --> 00:01:33,057
Urgent letter from the capital!

43
00:01:34,074 --> 00:01:34,953
Wei Shaoqing…

44
00:01:35,522 --> 00:01:36,465
took a portrait

45
00:01:37,598 --> 00:01:38,811
into the chancellor's mansion.
